OL,3,ATurnout so far highest in decades as
OL,4,AIsraelis vote in pivotal election
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurnout in Israel's election is at its
OL,7,Fhighest so far since 1977, as Israelis
OL,8,Fvote in what many view as one of the
OL,9,Fmost pivotal elections in the country's
OL,10,Fhistory.
OL,12,FPolling published on Friday suggests
OL,13,Fincumbent Benjamin Netanyahu is almost
OL,14,Fneck-and-neck with former military
OL,15,Fchief Gadi Eisenkot in the race to
OL,16,Fbecome prime minister.
OL,18,FBut neither of their political blocs
OL,19,Fare projected to win the 61 seats
OL,20,Fneeded to form a majority government -
OL,21,Fmeaning weeks or months of political
OL,22,Fwrangling may lie ahead.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
